<%# §4.2 step 1 — "responds with a Turbo Stream that renders the run's card in a
    `pending` state with a spinner." Prepended, so the newest run is the one at the
    top of the list. The job's own transitions arrive on the cable from here on. %>
<%= turbo_stream.prepend suggestion_runs_list_id, partial: "suggestion_runs/suggestion_run",
      locals: { suggestion_run: @suggestion_run } %>

<%# Resets the note field, the same way a quick add resets its own (§4.1). %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace new_suggestion_run_id, partial: "suggestion_runs/new_run" %>
